--  The contracts that the tests check (amv_tests.gpr, on top of -gnata):
--  every precondition, postcondition, predicate and piece of ghost code,
--  so that each test also compares the code with its contracts. The
--  steps of the proofs (loop invariants and variants, assertions) are
--  left to gnatprove: a quantified invariant checked at every iteration
--  would make a loop over an image quadratic. So are the parts of
--  postconditions at the assertion level Static; those at the level
--  Tested (declared here and in contracts.adc) are checked.

pragma Assertion_Level (Tested);

pragma Assertion_Policy
  (Loop_Invariant => Ignore, Loop_Variant => Ignore, Assert => Ignore,
   Assert_And_Cut => Ignore, Tested => Check);
